edit/process_snapshot expectations accordingly, OR adopt the file_impact_scope sentinel-value pattern (seed a distinct 'undeclared' sentinel and rewrite the test AC to assert the sentinel rather than key-absence).","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.4625,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'seeded in make_initial_state' (Approach) and AC line 1 'seeded in make_initial_state'","Plan Testing: 'a ticket created without the flag replays with the field absent ... asserting the absent case is not merely falsy is the point of the test'","_state.py:28-82 make_initial_state seeds every field unconditionally (e.g. file_impact_scope:'undeclared')","_processors.py:531-538 the cited file_impact_scope precedent distinguishes tri-state via a SENTINEL string value ('undeclared'/'none'/'paths'), NOT genuine key-absence"],"finding":"The tri-state mechanism for bridge_project is internally contradictory: the plan requires an 'absent' state that a test asserts is 'not merely falsy', yet also requires the field to be 'seeded in make_initial_state', which seeds every field unconditionally and therefore guarantees key-presence on every replayed ticket, making genuine key-absence unreachable.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f792410edf4a7fa8f","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach / Scope (src/rebar/reducer/_state.py make_initial_state) and Testing 'Three-state coverage'","norm_id":"nbdcb1051dd2848ff","priority":0.1375,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A legacy ticket (CREATE has no bridge_project) is replayed: make_initial_state has already set the key, so the compiled state carries the seed value present, not absent — the 'not merely falsy / absent' assertion cannot pass.","resolve_project (later story) tries to distinguish 'legacy, infer from binding' from 'explicit never-sync' but every ticket carries the same present seed value."],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"Follow the cited file_impact_